    "detailed_description": "Block Sumo is a local multiplayer game for 2 players.<br><br>Player 1 use WASD.<br>Player 2 use Arrow keys.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Step on your friend and turn him or her into stone, then push them down to abyss!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 1 vs 1 Gameplay. Duel with your buddy for bets!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 5 interesting series of scene.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Pick up items, use them wisely to turn the tide!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 35 different levels.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 20 pixel character skins.</li></ul><br>Single player mode: Joker Besides Me<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1380890/extras/8aff27cb3407ac091ecdeaecfb5d4107.poster.avif?t=1617370107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1380890/extras/8aff27cb3407ac091ecdeaecfb5d4107.webm?t=1617370107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1380890/extras/8aff27cb3407ac091ecdeaecfb5d4107.mp4?t=1617370107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Have fun!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1380890/extras/48bba6bfefa690480d0f571ff7b818fe.poster.avif?t=1617370107\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1380890/extras/48bba6bfefa690480d0f571ff7b818fe.webm?t=1617370107\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1380890/extras/48bba6bfefa690480d0f571ff7b818fe.mp4?t=1617370107\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
